{"id":"fe727d51d6f7e69a","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Subset Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-subset-closed-class — ZFC Subset Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class","58-df-zfc-supertransitive-class"],"display":"df-zfc-subset-closed-class — ZFC Subset Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class</span><span>58-df-zfc-supertransitive-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-subset-closed-class — ZFC Subset Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq V\">\\(C\\subseteq V\\)</span> (possibly proper class parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\)</span> is the class predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S,\\mathrm{SupertransitiveClass}_S:\\mathsf{Class}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S,\\mathrm{SupertransitiveClass}_S:\\mathsf{Class}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;(y\\subseteq x\\to y\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;(y\\subseteq x\\to y\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SupertransitiveClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S(C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SupertransitiveClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S(C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-supertransitive-class</code> is merged here; both predicates express closure under subsets of members.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)$ is the class predicate (see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S,\\mathrm{SupertransitiveClass}_S:\\mathsf{Class}\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land\\forall x\\in C\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;(y\\subseteq x\\to y\\in C)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}subset\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\mathrm{SupertransitiveClass}_S(C) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SubsetClosedClass}_S(C)","display":true}],"bytes":1135,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3503","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-subset-closed-class]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca2a9c9166fa8cce"]}